421	  // reveal the liveness watchdog can't catch (the agent is alive). An
422	  // explicit `next_question_ready === false` collapses the reveal to the
423	  // positive "next one's coming" hold immediately, instead of waiting out the
424	  // 12s reveal TTL. Distinct from `stale`: the agent is present and pushing.
425	  // NOT gated on revealPhase. The agent publishes next_question_ready
426	  // "false" whenever the game is running with nothing armed and nothing
