428	  // `question`, not reveal/scores: skip_question, flush_for_mode_switch,
429	  // on_answer_leak, and a delivery released after being cut too many
430	  // times. The flag was on the wire and the board rendered nothing for
431	  // all of them: no "next one's coming" badge, no announcement, just a
432	  // blank question zone. `null` until the backend publishes it, so only
